# These are notes between the two of us. They discuss prize money, tax forms,
# and who gets named on the payout. That is nobody else's business, and once
# it is in a public git history it is very hard to take back.
#
# They are shared privately instead:
#   - the working plan is a shared page, link in Discord
#   - the rest live in this folder on our own machines
#
# If we decide we want any of these public, delete the line and commit it.
